    "h": 65
   },
   "text": "<p class=\"bold\">Increased productivity with ZOLLER presetting and measuring machines</p> <p>The ZOLLER profitability calculator calculates the savings potential of your business.</p>",
   "button": "<a class=\"btn\" href=\"/tr/profitability-calculator\">Determine savings potential now</a>",
