  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> More productivity in milling, turning, and grinding </h2>",
   "body": "",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/2/csm_teaser_milling_6f80026943.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 377,
     "title": "Milling",
     "href": "/tr/milling",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Milling</h3> <p>Access precise tool presetting and measuring with the best balancing technology on the market — including tool heat shrinking, unshrinking, and every interface you'll need for a seamless CAM-to-part process. </p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/5/csm_teaser_turning_a68c271858.webp",
     "alt": "tool turning process",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 377,
     "title": "Turning",
     "href": "/tr/turn",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Turning</h3> <p>Unlock success with special measuring technology for turning tools, tool management, and data handling.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/f/csm_teaser_grinding_7de917acd6.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 377,
     "title": "Grinding",
     "href": "/tr/sharpening-tools",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Grinding</h3> <p>Achieve documented quality with machines that interface with CAD design. Use control-compatible data for your CNC grinding machine, simulate measuring runs, and process-related inspection and documentation.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    }
   ],
