  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> <a href=\"/tr/home\">Balancing tools with precision</a> </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The »toolBalancer« from ZOLLER is a state-of-the-art tool balancing machine that achieves balancing results &lt; 0.4 gmm with high ergonomics and simple operation. All »toolBalancers« are TÜV and UL/CSA approved.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/tr/products/balancing-technology/toolbalancer\">More about »toolBalancer«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/a/csm_teaser_toolbalancer_e584d45648.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1155,
